{"server":"cn","storyId":"act9mini_level_act9mini_st02","groupId":"act9mini","stageId":null,"title":"落灰","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act9mini/level_act9mini_st02.txt","sourceHash":"b766feeceb6fa33fcba679efc92e5798abf689d15fca4c18d6af8c36ba239597","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"灰毫格蕾纳蒂这一场比赛的对手是以残虐著称的“锈铜”英格拉。坚炮对利斧，感染者骑士对贵族骑士，未来对过去，到底哪一方会获得胜利呢？","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔1.5-灰松鼠"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，我们要去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威严的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还没到你提问的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威严的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拿稳小炮，跟紧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的奶奶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威严的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_1"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那边是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威严的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"竞技场，从大骑士领来的家伙们建的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威严的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们是要去看比赛吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威严的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"比赛？不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威严的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我要带你去参加训练。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威严的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还记得我教你的东西吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，奶奶，我记得很清楚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"架盾、起炮、轰击！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"盯紧敌人、注意弹药、炮不离手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还有，嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"炮声轰鸣，胜利已在眼前！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威严的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威严的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你比你的父亲要可靠得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威严的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"至少在我闭上眼前，还有人能够记得这些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，请别说这样的丧气话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威严的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵，古木哪有不烂的道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威严的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"与其就这么腐朽掉，不如做新芽的肥料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威严的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威严的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不必，只是咳嗽一下，没什么好担心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威严的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你父亲那一辈，甚至我的几位兄弟，早都忘了卡利斯卡是怎么繁荣的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威严的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"林业？那片林子是我们靠功勋、靠火炮换回来的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威严的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“炮声轰鸣，胜利已在眼前”......那帮见钱眼开的家伙连格言都记不住了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，请您别生气了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威严的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威严的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾纳蒂，你是棵好苗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威严的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可别长歪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是，我不会让您失望的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沸血骑士团——竞技场屠夫——养好伤后再度归来——一如既往的残暴！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而另一边——另一边是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威严的祖母","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"曾经的南方林业巨子——卡利斯卡集团的一员——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如今则是一位感染者——隶属于红松骑士团——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"让我们欢迎——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（呼......放轻松，奶奶已经教会我了，我可以的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（我准备好了！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"灰毫骑士，格蕾纳蒂·卡利斯卡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，小灰终于进场了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾纳蒂进场总是慢悠悠的，也不和观众表示一下，一点都不痛快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是卖点嘛，有人可喜欢这一套了，你看那儿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的粉丝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾纳蒂！格蕾纳蒂看我一眼呀！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......行吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欢呼声作不了假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且那个持炮的姿势，还挺有贵族范的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然我最期待的还是她开炮轰人的时候啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"那是肯定有的啦，听到轰隆隆的响声观众可兴奋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是有更过瘾的就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，你还想看她用炮筒砸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，有机会还真想见识一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"巨斧对坚盾！究竟谁才是最后的赢家，让我们拭目以待！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"点开您的终端，做出您的选择，支持您的选手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"当然更重要的是，给自己一个填满钱包的机会！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"比赛——开始——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"你手上那块塑料最好能多撑一会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"矿石病垃圾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真没劲，上了赛场就话都不多说一句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"你又不是第一次看小灰比赛，那叫认真，认真懂不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这样很无聊啊......不发泄一下情绪，怎么在气势上压过对手哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"骑士竞技又不是谁嗓门大谁赢呀，主要是对抗得好看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"看嘛，就是这样的。锈铜被逼退了，大家也都很高兴，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是今天这场，是不是太稳了？连主动攻击都很少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"这也得挑对手嘛，遇上锈铜这种偏重进攻的骑士，组织好防御才是最佳策略。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"而且小灰又能用她最爱的技巧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"盾击挡开接一炮，百试不爽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"（小灰这一场进攻欲望是不太强，她到底在想什么啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"令人惊讶，屠夫的切肉斧在灰毫骑士面前居然毫无办法！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"每一次格挡，每一发炮击都让英格拉无功而返！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"灰毫骑士的防御完美无缺，她正在一点点推进，压缩属于屠夫的活动空间！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"毫无疑问，这将是一场拉锯战，不到最后一刻，谁都不知道胜利的桂冠花落谁家！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"赶紧拿起终端为您支持的选手下注吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"抑或是即刻订购一瓶印有选手logo的赛场特供冰镇矿泉水，让身旁的观众知道您到底支持哪一方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"现在下单，立刻有专人为您送至座位！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有这种东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"真的有，只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这价格......我为什么不去赛场外面买十瓶回来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不会下单了吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"就买一瓶尝尝鲜，嘿嘿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"你就只会缩在那塑料板后面吗，嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"喝，等我敲碎它，你有的是时间尖叫，石头老鼠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"卡利斯卡这样的小企业是不会给你收尸的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（扣下扳机）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇，小灰生气了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"英格拉也太毒了吧，揪着人痛点不放干嘛呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡利斯卡林业以前还是挺有名气的，最近倒是听不到什么新闻了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会真的和格蕾纳蒂有关吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"要真让小灰来经营，他们家的公司说不定现在还能做大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"自己经营不善，就把气撒在别人头上，这样的公司肯定做不好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"听说小灰是在一桌子叔父叔母面前被全体表决逐出家族的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"全票通过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那她父母......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"听说也被要挟着把自己的女儿投出家族了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然回家以后还是给小灰准备了来大骑士领的资金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"但你也应该知道吧，本应该支持自己的父母都举起了手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"太痛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"还好小灰够坚强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"特别坚强。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......她不会真生气了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"还好还好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种时候生气不是很正常的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我肯定先把锈铜捅个对穿再考虑其他问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"小灰的打法太耗脑子了，弹药数量又有限，赌气多打一发弹药可能就输了呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"现在应该还在让锈铜以为自己生气了的阶段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，误导对手也是很重要的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"你看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"令人震惊，英格拉的肩甲居然被轰碎了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"灰毫骑士仍旧在步步紧逼，难道胜负马上就要揭晓了吗！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"又是一声炮响，看来灰毫骑士已经准备好亲手拉响胜利的礼炮了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"发生什么事了？！各位观众看到了吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚锈铜居然用斧头劈开了一枚炮弹！感谢两位选手，为我们上演了一出在电视剧集中才能见到的场面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我说的正是斯沃玛视频投资拍摄的都市悬疑电视剧《大骑士领二十四夜》中的经典场景，有兴趣的观众可以立即下单购买光碟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"前三十名购入者可以获得男女主角签名海报一张，先到先得，过时不候！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"咕咚咕咚——呼，这水和路边便利店买的也没什么区别嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是早提醒过你了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嘻嘻，算啦，就当付了笔代购费吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"话说回来，莫布还真是不放过每一个能做广告的机会啊，真烦人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是他的工作嘛，理解一下啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"不过谁能想到锈铜会斧劈炮弹呢，硬生生给了莫布一个插广告的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是那一下小灰心软了，想着把锈铜轰倒，就没瞄准脑袋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"比赛现在就结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她弹匣里炮弹不多了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"应该只剩一发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"该换弹匣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"希望英格拉别在这时候给咱家小灰添什么麻烦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（还有一发吗。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（把他轰退的同时借力后撤，争取到的时间应该足够。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（以英格拉的竞赛风格，应该不会有后手。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（时机差不多了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"你就这点本事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（变快了？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（不好！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"锈铜鞋子上那是，推进器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"这一下可麻烦了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"加油啊小灰！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"没了炮弹，你还能做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"小灰，你还有弹药吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，备用弹匣刚刚用来挡弩箭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"那怎么办，用炮筒砸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"有需要的话我可以分心帮你对付几个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"然后像之前那样乘机拿走我的分数？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"别再惦记那件事啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"当初大家初次见面，没有提防才有问题啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"以后不会了，我们约定过的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我能相信格蕾纳蒂不会为了自己的利益牺牲其他感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾纳蒂也相信索娜不会背后捅她刀子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"对不对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼，算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"那你准备怎么对付面前的骑士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的能腾出空来帮一把的，有需要就赶紧说哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"我有我的办法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚还占据优势的灰毫骑士在换弹时被抓住破绽，锈铜开始了复仇，难道屠夫的切肉斧终究还是要见血了吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"灰毫骑士究竟会如何反击呢，我们看到她——她拆下空弹匣甩向锈铜，然而没有任何——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"哦不对，她甚至丢下了炮冲向锈铜，她到底要做什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"英格拉举起了武器，灰毫骑士却只剩一面盾牌！灰毫——灰毫格开了战斧，然后——喔！！一击头槌，连我这儿都听得到响声！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"喔！一套连贯的徒手打击，英格拉后退了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾纳蒂一个翻滚回到了她的武器旁，换弹，上膛，一气呵成！英格拉又要再次被炮火支配了吗！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈，我们又一次听到了炮响，灰毫骑士重新掌握了局面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然难看了点......这脱身方法还挺实用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我真的没想到她丢下那门炮之后速度会那么快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"小灰也是札拉克嘛，灵活一点很正常的啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那她为什么不和你一样用轻巧点的武器呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"个人爱好呗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我是建议过她换件更适合在赛场上使用的远程武器，标枪啊、弩啦、投石索之类的，她都不喜欢，就是爱用那门从老家带来的炮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"有时候根本施展不开，维护还费时费力的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是固执。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"习惯就好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她剩下的弹药就只有最后八发了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果打完了会发生什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道欸，会发生什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我是从来没见过小灰把备弹全部打完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼，呼，你是在羞辱我吗，灰毫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"说话啊，你这个，石头！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（扣下扳机）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"你准备装哑巴到什么时候！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"受够了，我受够了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"喝啊！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"小灰真的太坏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不会从一开始就准备和英格拉玩拉锯战的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又不回话又打不倒，换我我也气。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，你来啦查丝汀娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"灰毫她为什么要羞辱锈铜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"这个，说来话就长啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我碰见小灰的时候，她就对观众席上面的骑士老爷们一肚子怒火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"其他的感染者骑士都觉得她只是单纯地对骑士老爷不满。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"但是她——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"如果没有感染的话，她也是骑士贵族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我听说过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"在受到感染后，她骑士家族的长辈同辈没有一个人对她表示过同情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都将家族的逐渐衰落归咎在她身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正常人都知道这和得病没关系啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"但他们就这样做了，她的家族，卡利斯卡的札拉克们一致同意剥夺小灰的地位，把她踢出家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"小灰曾经是那么信赖这些亲属，愿意与他们分享趣事，愿意同他们切磋武艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"但最后，小灰以为的至亲好友，一位都没伸出援手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"听说还有人恨不得让她彻底从大地上消失——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这，不至于吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"那天我也在，帮小灰挡了一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"你们应该能理解小灰为什么对骑士老爷们深恶痛绝了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"至于锈铜英格拉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"他所做的每一件事，都在深深刺痛小灰的心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是这个原因，小灰才准备在拉锯战中对抗到最后吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"为了将一位高高在上的骑士老爷彻底打倒在地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"也为了......平息她自己的愤怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，查丝汀娜，帮我看看小灰弹匣里还有几发炮弹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......四发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"噢哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"快要结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"一阵猛烈的攻势并没有击倒灰毫骑士，锈铜却开始体力不支了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"我们能看到他正准备发起最后的冲锋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"漫长的拉锯战马上就能见分晓了吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"请各位观众注意您的投注号码，说不定在胜负见分晓的同时，还能获得一份意外大礼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"本场赛后幸运抽奖由呼啸守卫赞助，概率竟然是惊人的百分之零点五！还没有下注的观众，请抓住这最后的机会！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"英格拉举起了他的屠刀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾纳蒂也摆出了一个防御姿态！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"胜负马上就要见分晓了吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，小灰她什么时候偷学我的招！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"锈铜在冲锋，锈铜还在冲锋，灰毫也举起盾牌，却把炮口对准了身后！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"难道她要硬接下锈铜一击吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"双方越来越近，越来越近了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"借着炮击的加速度，灰毫居然从锈铜的斧旁蹿了过去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"太快了太快了！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"她舍弃了盾牌，把炮口摁在英格拉后背上扣动了扳机！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"锈铜骑士倒下了！灰毫骑士获得了胜利！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，灰毫骑士又一次把炮口对准了锈铜，难道，残虐的英格拉也有被欺凌的一天吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵，缩在壳里的札拉克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"灰毫......格蕾纳蒂......我记住......你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"等我养好伤......你......你们感染者，一个都逃不掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（扣住扳机）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（将炮口对准天空）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"这一枚炮弹是献给观众的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"你不配。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锈铜骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_104","isRemote":false,"text":"你......呜......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"灰毫骑士最终没有攻击倒下的英格拉，在打出最后一发炮弹后，她独自一人走向了出口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的粉丝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾纳蒂！格蕾纳蒂——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"本次比赛——抽奖——奖金——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这一次感觉怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成长的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是很好，父亲，火炮拿久了手还是会抖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要不要换一件更轻便的武器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成长的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不用，火炮很适合我，它的威力能够补足灵活性上的不足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成长的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且，或许某一天，我将不在赛场，而是到更广阔的地方作战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成长的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就像祖母那样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成长的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到那个时候，这件武器一定会变得更加实用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......听你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小坚果啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成长的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"父亲，我不是小孩子了，您没有必要这样称呼我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾纳蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这次训练做得不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶如果看到你现在的成果，一定会开心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成长的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祖母......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶走之前和几位大伯做过约定，只要你想学，他们就会继续资助你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以不用担心钱的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"无论你最终成为骑士还是继承家业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"继续练习下去，总有一天，你会成为卡西米尔知名的火炮手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，卡利斯卡家已经多少代没有出过一名真正的火炮手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想必各位长辈和祖辈都会为你而骄傲吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的父亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可不要让他们失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成长的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成长的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，父亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"成长的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我会的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，小灰，小灰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么突然开始发呆了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，在想些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"英格拉可真惨，刚从医院出来就又被你送回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"他罪有应得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"那最后一发还往天上打？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"比赛已经结束了，就算我再看不起英格拉，也不能再对他下手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"不然我和他又有什么区别？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜了，本来还想在报纸上看到“屠夫惨遭屠戮”之类的标题来着......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"英格拉家族让这则新闻上不了报纸的可能性比较大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"索娜，其实我从刚才就想问你个问题......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，怎么了小灰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"你手上拿着的，是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"你的应援水瓶啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"索娜你怎么又买这种无聊的东西了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"还好啦，主要是那时候有点口渴又懒得出去买水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，我们的骑士凯旋啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也要向灰毫学习，变得更强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"查丝汀娜，“那件事”怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......完成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"好叻，辛苦辛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"这次的奖金一到账我就会汇去“那个账号”，听说银行那边已经开始关注最近的频繁转账问题了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"还能用个人消费糊弄一下吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......你觉得呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"也是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"留给我们的时间，不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"不过现在还没到考虑这个的时候啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我们先去庆祝一下吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
